WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:03.972
Point one service at another, even when its port is assigned at start.

00:04.422 --> 00:07.673
The API address is a reference, not a fixed port.

00:08.123 --> 00:09.284
Start the stack.

00:09.734 --> 00:13.124
devhost fills in the API's port and starts the API first.

00:13.574 --> 00:16.314
The web service called the API at the resolved address.

00:18.574 --> 00:20.710
One command stops both services.
